  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "30MMバイロン軍から待望の重量級量産機が登場！シリーズ初の量産機同士の合体機構を搭載！",
      "en": "The long-awaited heavyweight mass-produced machine from the 30MM Byron Army has arrived! Equipped with a combination mechanism between mass-produced machines for the first time in the series!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 重装甲の機体を支える脚部は30MM史上最大ボリューム。",
      "en": "• The legs that support the heavily armored aircraft have the largest volume in 30MM history."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 30MM素体としては初めて腰部に可動式のフロントアーマーを採用。",
      "en": "• This is the first 30MM body to feature a movable front armor on the waist."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 武装はライフルが付属。",
      "en": "• Armed with a rifle."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• シリーズ初の量産機同士の合体機構を搭載。別売りのガルドノヴァと合体すれば、重装甲機体を組み合わせて更に大型機体に！",
      "en": "• Equipped with a mechanism for combining mass-produced machines for the first time in the series. If you combine it with Gardonova (sold separately), you can combine a heavily armored aircraft to create an even larger aircraft!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 既存機体やオプションパーツとのカスタマイズも可能。 無限のカスタマイズで自分だけの量産機を作り出せ！",
      "en": "• Can also be customized with existing aircraft and optional parts. Create your own mass-produced machine with unlimited customization!"
    }
  ],
